---
// src/components/Solution.astro — Pilares SPARK: 3 Aether Cards com gamificação
---

<section id="metodo" class="py-32 px-4 sm:px-8 relative border-t border-[#1a1a1a]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mb-16" data-anim="fade-up">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full badge-glow mb-4">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e] micro-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#3ecf8e] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Como Funciona</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight mt-2 text-[#fafafa] leading-[1.05] max-w-2xl">
        Três pilares.<br />
        <span class="text-gradient-emerald">Uma ascensão real.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#898989] text-base mt-4 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Ciência de memória espaçada, prática diária gamificada e mentoria humana semanal. Os três juntos formam o método SPARK.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Aether Cards -->
    <div id="pilares-grid" class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

      <!-- Card 1: FSRS Revisão Espaçada -->
      <div class="aether-card p-8 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]" data-anim="fade-up">
        <!-- Accent glow corner -->
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -left-16 w-40 h-40 bg-[#3ecf8e]/8 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- Visual: Curva de Retenção FSRS vs Tradicional -->
        <div class="mb-8 relative h-32">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 240 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
            <!-- Grid lines -->
            <line x1="0" y1="20" x2="240" y2="20" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="0" y1="50" x2="240" y2="50" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="0" y1="80" x2="240" y2="80" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1"/>

            <!-- Traditional: forgetting curve (red-ish) -->
            <path d="M 0 20 C 30 20, 50 30, 60 50 C 70 70, 80 85, 240 90"
                  stroke="#f87171" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
            <text x="170" y="92" fill="#f87171" font-size="8" opacity="0.8" font-family="monospace">Método tradicional</text>

            <!-- FSRS: staircase retention (emerald) -->
            <!-- Segment 1 -->
            <path d="M 0 20 C 15 20, 25 35, 50 55" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
            <!-- Review 1 (spike up) -->
            <line x1="50" y1="55" x2="50" y2="22" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" opacity="0.5"/>
            <!-- Segment 2 -->
            <path d="M 50 22 C 70 22, 80 38, 110 56" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
            <!-- Review 2 -->
            <line x1="110" y1="56" x2="110" y2="20" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" opacity="0.5"/>
            <!-- Segment 3 -->
            <path d="M 110 20 C 140 20, 160 34, 200 50" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
            <!-- Review 3 -->
            <line x1="200" y1="50" x2="200" y2="17" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" opacity="0.5"/>
            <!-- Segment 4 final -->
            <path d="M 200 17 L 240 17" stroke="#3ecf8e" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>

            <!-- FSRS Label -->
            <text x="206" y="12" fill="#3ecf8e" font-size="8" font-weight="600" font-family="monospace">FSRS</text>

            <!-- Y axis labels -->
            <text x="2" y="18" fill="#71717a" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">100%</text>
            <text x="2" y="90" fill="#71717a" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">0%</text>
          </svg>
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#71717a]">Retenção ao longo do tempo</div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#3ecf8e] border-[#3ecf8e]/25 bg-[#3ecf8e]/10">Pilar 01 · Ciência</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#fafafa] mb-2 tracking-tight">Revisão Espaçada FSRS</h3>
          <p class="text-[#898989] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
            O algoritmo FSRS calcula o momento exato antes que você esqueça. Cada revisão é cirúrgica — sem repetir o que você já sabe, sem perder o que está consolidando.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#71717a]">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e]"></span>
            <span>Retenção média: 92%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: PlayApp SPARK (central, destaque sutil) -->
      <div
        class="aether-card p-8 flex flex-col min-h-[420px] border-[#3ecf8e]/20"
        style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111111 0%, #0d1a12 100%);"
        data-anim="fade-up"
      >
        <div class="absolute -top-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-[#3ecf8e]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- Mini Missão Mock -->
        <div class="mb-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1f2e1f] p-4 relative overflow-hidden">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#3ecf8e] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">SPARK ALPHA · DIA 5</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#71717a]">15 min</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Mission title -->
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#fafafa] mb-2">🎯 Missão: Job Interview Prep</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-[#898989] mb-3 leading-relaxed">
            Responda: "Tell me about yourself" usando seus <span class="text-[#3ecf8e]">chunks do dia</span>.
          </div>

          <!-- XP Bar -->
          <div class="mb-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#f59e0b]">⭐ XP</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#898989]">1.840 / 2.400</span>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-bar-track">
              <div class="xp-bar-fill" style="width: 76%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Streak badge -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]/15 border border-[#f59e0b]/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#f59e0b]">
              🔥 14 dias streak
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#3ecf8e]/15 border border-[#3ecf8e]/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#3ecf8e]">
              ✅ 3/5 tarefas
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#3ecf8e] border-[#3ecf8e]/30 bg-[#3ecf8e]/15">Pilar 02 · Prática</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#71717a]">24/7</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#fafafa] mb-2 tracking-tight">PlayApp SPARK Alpha</h3>
          <p class="text-[#898989] text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Missões diárias gamificadas de 15 min. Chunks reais, progressão em XP, streaks e bosses desbloqueáveis. Você não estuda — você joga.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Mentoria 1 a 1 -->
      <div class="aether-card p-8 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]" data-anim="fade-up">
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 bg-[#818cf8]/8 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- Visual: Waveform de áudio com análise -->
        <div class="mb-8 relative h-32 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#71717a] mb-2">Sessão ao vivo · Gravação 03</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-[2px] h-12">
            {[8,14,22,36,28,18,44,30,16,42,26,52,38,20,46,32,56,24,44,30,52,26,40,34,48,22,42,36,18,28,14,20,34,46,28,38,52,24,44].map((h, i) => (
              <div
                class="rounded-full flex-1 wave-bar"
                style={`height:${h}px; background:${i > 18 ? '#818cf8' : '#3ecf8e'}; opacity:${0.4 + (i % 5) * 0.1}; animation-delay:${i * 0.04}s;`}
              ></div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <!-- Feedback badge -->
          <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#818cf8]/15 border border-[#818cf8]/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#818cf8]">
              ⚡ Feedback camadas
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#71717a]">Duração 23min</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#818cf8] border-[#818cf8]/25 bg-[#818cf8]/10">Pilar 03 · Humano</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#fafafa] mb-2 tracking-tight">Mentoria 1 a 1 ao Vivo</h3>
          <p class="text-[#898989] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Toda semana, sessões individuais com Gabriel Lima. Sem grupos, sem agenda compartilhada. Feedback em camadas, trabalho direto nas suas travas específicas.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#d4d4d8] border-[#2e2e2e]">2x Rápidas/sem</span>
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#d4d4d8] border-[#2e2e2e]">1x Estendida/sem</span>
            <span class="topic-badge text-[#818cf8] border-[#818cf8]/30 bg-[#818cf8]/10">100% Individual</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  function ready(fn) {
    if (document.readyState !== 'loading') fn(); else document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', fn);
  }
  ready(function () {
    var gsap = window.gsap;
    var ST = window.ScrollTrigger;
    if (!gsap || !ST || reduced) return;

    gsap.from('#pilares-grid .aether-card', {
      y: 45,
      opacity: 0,
      duration: 0.85,
      stagger: 0.12,
      ease: 'power3.out',
      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#metodo', start: 'top 75%' }
    });

    gsap.from('#metodo [data-anim="fade-up"]:first-child', {
      y: 30,
      opacity: 0,
      duration: 0.7,
      ease: 'power3.out',
      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#metodo', start: 'top 80%' }
    });
  });
})();
</script>
